\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.70<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20101204195105&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunting_Horn_7f94bb.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a hunting horn.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A hermit near Carlin might be able to tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This is the item used to tame a <a href=\"#/wiki/Boar\">Boar</a>. It has a chance of breaking when used. Due to its rarity, this item has become a highly desired decorative piece in prestigious guilds.<br/>\nWhen you use it, you may get the following messages:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The boar is refusing to obey the hunting horn.</span> — Nothing happens and you may try again</li>\n<li><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The boar ran away.</span> — The boar disappears and you will have to find another one</li>\n<li><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Oh no! The hunting horn broke.</span> — Hunting horn disappears</li>\n<li><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You tamed the wild boar.</span> — You tamed the boar</li></ul>\n<p>Very rare reward of the \"Lucky Loop\" task of the <a href=\"#/quest/rottin-wood-and-the-married-men-quest\">Rottin Wood and the Married Men Quest</a>. Some people do the task for months (with more than one character) until they get this item.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boar\">Boar</a></li><li>Contest Prizes</li><li>Pig-Headed</li><li>Quests</li><li>Rapid Boar</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/rottin-wood-and-the-married-men-quest\">Rottin Wood and the Married Men Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["rottin-wood-and-the-married-men-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"rottin-wood-and-the-married-men-quest","quest":"Rottin Wood and the Married Men Quest","step":"3-2","n":16,"title":"Lucky Loop: entregar","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":32657,"y":32201,"z":7,"label":"Rottin Wood"}]}]}}